00:13:44.283 --> 00:13:46.159
Is television sensation Bender

00:13:46.243 --> 00:13:48.871
a bad role model for Earth's children?

00:13:48.954 --> 00:13:50.789
That's crazy.

00:13:50.873 --> 00:13:54.126
A new protest group,
Father's Against Rude Television,

00:13:54.209 --> 00:13:55.711
says, "Hell, yes."

00:13:55.794 --> 00:13:59.089
What kind of bozos
would start a Bender protest group?

00:13:59.173 --> 00:14:01.133
Good news, everyone.

00:14:01.216 --> 00:14:04.595
Hermes and I have started
a Bender protest group.

00:14:04.678 --> 00:14:05.971
That was uncanny.

00:14:06.054 --> 00:14:07.848
Fathers Against Rude Television

00:14:07.931 --> 00:14:11.185
don't want our kids watching
Bender's high-definition filth.

00:14:11.268 --> 00:14:12.519
And for what?

00:14:12.603 --> 00:14:14.188
Some kind of cheap laugh?

00:14:14.271 --> 00:14:17.357
That's not what F.A.R.T. is all about.

00:14:17.441 --> 00:14:19.651
No, sir. Not us FARTers.

00:14:19.735 --> 00:14:21.862
Whoa, whoa, whoa! You can't censor me

00:14:21.945 --> 00:14:24.323
just 'cause
I'm an obscenely bad role model.

00:14:24.406 --> 00:14:27.367
As unclean as it makes me feel,
I agree with Bender.

00:14:27.451 --> 00:14:29.870
Kids don't turn rotten
just from watching TV.

00:14:29.995 --> 00:14:32.956
Yeah, give a little credit
to our public schools.

00:14:38.545 --> 00:14:42.007
Our dads are all pumped up
on dorkosterone.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.468
We're just trying to be cool, like Bender.

00:14:44.551 --> 00:14:46.595
Yeah, and it's not even working.

00:14:46.678 --> 00:14:48.472
Smoking and drinking make us barf.

00:14:48.555 --> 00:14:52.351
Gentle jerkwads, I know how to
emulate Bender without barfing.

00:14:52.476 --> 00:14:54.019
We could commit a burglary.

00:14:54.102 --> 00:14:55.270
Hey, yeah!

00:14:55.354 --> 00:14:56.688
Bender loves to burgle.

00:14:56.772 --> 00:14:58.565
Hold up, though. Who could we rob?

00:14:58.649 --> 00:15:00.567
We don't even know anyone with cool stuff.

00:15:00.651 --> 00:15:05.405
Duh! We know someone who runs on
pure cool fuel... Bender.

00:15:05.489 --> 00:15:07.741
- Whoa!
- We'll rob Bender.

00:15:08.909 --> 00:15:11.078
TV gave us the idea.

00:15:11.328 --> 00:15:13.330
You're watching Futurama,

00:15:13.413 --> 00:15:17.376
the show that does not advocate
the cool crime of robbery.

00:15:25.509 --> 00:15:29.096
Okay, it's crime time.

00:15:39.439 --> 00:15:40.691
Hey, Bender.

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.402
Hey, Bender.

00:15:44.736 --> 00:15:46.071
Hey, Bender.

00:15:48.574 --> 00:15:49.825
Hey, Bender.

00:15:49.908 --> 00:15:51.326
Bust it

00:16:06.341 --> 00:16:08.260
Okay, smarty, go to a party

00:16:08.343 --> 00:16:10.304
Girls are scantily clad and showin' body

00:16:10.387 --> 00:16:11.388
A chick walks by...

00:16:13.182 --> 00:16:14.558
What's going on in here?

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:19.146
Oh, now I'm really outraged.

00:16:19.229 --> 00:16:21.148
Where did you requisition this party?

00:16:21.231 --> 00:16:23.192
And Zoidberg, what are you doing here?

00:16:23.275 --> 00:16:24.651
I'm networking.

00:16:24.735 --> 00:16:26.153
Let me give you my card.

00:16:26.862 --> 00:16:29.907
Relax, Dad, we just invited
a few friends over.

00:16:30.032 --> 00:16:31.033
Hmm...

00:16:31.116 --> 00:16:35.621
There's something wrong with your story
but I can't put my finger on it.

00:16:35.704 --> 00:16:38.707
Of course!
You don't have any friends!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.586
Yeah, why do these popular kids
consider you cool all of a sudden?

00:16:42.669 --> 00:16:44.505
Um, we're just cool is all.

00:16:44.588 --> 00:16:45.881
Balderdash!

00:16:45.964 --> 00:16:49.760
I'll be the judge of who's cool,
using the Coolometer.

00:17:02.856 --> 00:17:04.107
Oh, yeah.

00:17:04.191 --> 00:17:08.612
Good Lord, I'm getting a reading
of over 40 megafonzies.

00:17:08.695 --> 00:17:09.696
Everybody out!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:15.827
So, do you guys know about
anything else going on?

00:17:15.911 --> 00:17:18.497
Because I'm totally still ready to party.

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:23.168
There's enough cool stuff here
to furnish a happening pad.

00:17:23.252 --> 00:17:24.711
Where did it all come from?

00:17:24.795 --> 00:17:25.921
Don't tell, comrades.

00:17:26.004 --> 00:17:27.881
All for one and one for all!

00:17:29.007 --> 00:17:30.759
We stole it!

00:17:30.843 --> 00:17:31.927
Oh, crumb.

00:17:35.722 --> 00:17:37.307
What? What's going on?

00:17:37.391 --> 00:17:38.642
I'll tell you what.

00:17:38.725 --> 00:17:40.769
Our boys have taken up stealing!

00:17:40.853 --> 00:17:43.355
One of the worst and coolest of crimes.

00:17:43.438 --> 00:17:46.567
And all from watching you on TV,
you cool jerk.

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:48.110
Hey, lay off me.

00:17:48.193 --> 00:17:51.363
TV would stink if everyone on it
was a positive role model.

00:17:51.655 --> 00:17:53.991
Bender is about entertainment, baby.

00:17:54.074 --> 00:17:56.869
You can't hold me responsible
for what kids do when...

00:17:56.952 --> 00:17:59.079
Hey, this is my stuff they stole!

00:17:59.162 --> 00:18:00.706
That's the last straw!

00:18:00.789 --> 00:18:03.417
Bender should not be
allowed on television!

00:18:05.043 --> 00:18:07.254
Bender must be stopped.

00:18:07.337 --> 00:18:08.672
I've gone too far.

00:18:08.755 --> 00:18:10.507
Who does that guy think I am?

00:18:12.551 --> 00:18:15.846
Come on, we're going to march
all the way to Hollywood

00:18:15.929 --> 00:18:19.683
and make them stop forcing
their filthy me down our throats.

00:18:39.328 --> 00:18:42.831
Down with Bender!
Down with Bender!

00:18:42.915 --> 00:18:44.708
Down with Bender!

00:18:44.791 --> 00:18:46.251
Down with Bender!

00:18:46.335 --> 00:18:47.336
This mob's with me.

00:18:47.419 --> 00:18:48.420
Go ahead.

00:18:49.463 --> 00:18:52.758
Down with Bender! Down with Bender!

00:18:52.841 --> 00:18:54.676
Down with Bender!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.261
Down with...

00:18:59.056 --> 00:19:00.057
...Bender!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:01.475
Down with Bender!

00:19:01.558 --> 00:19:05.521
As a doctor and captain
of this hospital ship,

00:19:05.604 --> 00:19:08.065
I now pronounce you man and wife

00:19:08.148 --> 00:19:09.399
with six months to live.

00:19:11.401 --> 00:19:13.111
Listen up, Hollywood.

00:19:13.195 --> 00:19:15.030
We're an exciting new mob.

00:19:15.113 --> 00:19:16.990
You better believe it.

00:19:17.074 --> 00:19:18.325
Great Shatner's ghost!

00:19:18.408 --> 00:19:21.995
We demand that all TV
be equipped with a B-chip

00:19:22.079 --> 00:19:24.706
that blocks Bender
from appearing on the screen.

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:25.832
Boo-yah!

00:19:28.126 --> 00:19:31.839
I'm afraid the answer
is a gritty, in-your-face no.

00:19:31.922 --> 00:19:33.048
Then I quit.

00:19:33.131 --> 00:19:34.424
Then you don't quit.

00:19:37.803 --> 00:19:40.514
I think you'll be finishing
the scene now, Mr. Bender,

00:19:40.597 --> 00:19:42.516
and don't skimp on the nasty.

00:19:42.599 --> 00:19:44.726
There'll be no further nasty.

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.980
We still have the option
of resorting to violence.

00:19:48.397 --> 00:19:49.773
What makes you think that will work?

00:19:49.857 --> 00:19:54.236
I saw it on TV in that episode
where Bender shot Calculon.

00:19:54.444 --> 00:19:55.654
How cool was that.

00:19:55.737 --> 00:19:57.072
Ooh, yeah, come on...

00:19:58.365 --> 00:19:59.366
Quit the show.

00:19:59.491 --> 00:20:00.784
Do the scene.

00:20:00.868 --> 00:20:03.078
I'm a cold-blooded punk.

00:20:03.161 --> 00:20:06.540
I once put a laugh track
on a sitcom that had no jokes in it.

00:20:06.623 --> 00:20:08.542
Hey, look, the prop guy has a lamp.

00:20:08.625 --> 00:20:09.918
Wha...

00:20:10.252 --> 00:20:11.420
A-ha!

00:20:11.503 --> 00:20:13.172
I was using that.

00:20:13.255 --> 00:20:15.966
Listen up,
'cause I've got a climatic speech.

00:20:16.049 --> 00:20:18.385
You, cameraman, keep the camera rolling.

00:20:18.468 --> 00:20:20.679
You, director, give me my motivation.

00:20:20.762 --> 00:20:21.763
You're angry.

00:20:21.847 --> 00:20:22.931
Perfect.

00:20:23.015 --> 00:20:24.641
Viewers of the world,

00:20:24.725 --> 00:20:28.061
do smoking and drinking on TV
really make me cool?

00:20:28.395 --> 00:20:29.855
Of course they do.

00:20:30.522 --> 00:20:32.441
How about committing crimes and violence?

00:20:32.649 --> 00:20:34.443
Again, the answer is yes.

00:20:34.985 --> 00:20:36.904
But do we really want our kids exposed

00:20:36.987 --> 00:20:38.947
to that kind of trash on TV?

00:20:39.031 --> 00:20:41.325
I say absolutely not.

00:20:41.408 --> 00:20:42.409
Ooh!

00:20:44.703 --> 00:20:48.999
Uh, on the other hand, most,
perhaps all the blame

00:20:49.082 --> 00:20:50.542
rests with the parents.

00:20:50.626 --> 00:20:51.793
That's right, you.

00:20:53.754 --> 00:20:57.257
And so I ask you this one question...

00:20:57.341 --> 00:21:01.386
Have you ever tried simply
turning off the TV,

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.597
sitting down with your children

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:04.973
and hitting them?

00:21:05.307 --> 00:21:06.934
We're just so busy.

00:21:07.017 --> 00:21:08.310
Well, make time.

00:21:08.393 --> 00:21:09.728
And, cut.

00:21:10.521 --> 00:21:11.605
Good enough.

00:21:11.688 --> 00:21:15.108
Splice in some reaction shots of me
and shove it on the air.

00:21:17.861 --> 00:21:21.323
Have you ever tried
simply turning off the TV

00:21:21.406 --> 00:21:24.826
sitting down with your children
and hitting them?

00:21:26.453 --> 00:21:29.164
Well, I'd say we all
learned a valuable lesson

00:21:29.248 --> 00:21:30.624
about TV there.

00:21:30.707 --> 00:21:31.792
What was it?

00:21:31.875 --> 00:21:35.879
Uh, that we should all take TV
a little less seriously.

00:21:36.255 --> 00:21:39.174
And more importantly,
turn it off once in a while.

00:21:39.258 --> 00:21:41.134
- Hear! Hear!
- Darn right.

00:21:41.218 --> 00:21:43.136
So, should we turn it off now?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:46.390
Well, uh, that depends what's on.

00:21:47.683 --> 00:21:48.851
Nothing good.

00:21:48.934 --> 00:21:50.978
Eh, let's just keep watching.

00:21:57.985 --> 00:21:59.152
TV party tonight

00:21:59.236 --> 00:22:00.237
Wha...

00:22:00.362 --> 00:22:02.614
TV party tonight

00:22:02.698 --> 00:22:05.617
We've got nothing better to do

00:22:05.701 --> 00:22:09.371
Than watch TV and have a couple of brews

00:22:09.454 --> 00:22:12.249
Don't want to talk
about anything else

00:22:12.332 --> 00:22:14.209
We don't want to know

00:22:14.626 --> 00:22:17.212
We're dedicated, yes

00:22:17.296 --> 00:22:19.715
To our favorite shows

00:22:19.798 --> 00:22:21.049
All My Circuits

00:22:21.133 --> 00:22:23.010
Everybody Loves Hypnotoad

00:22:23.093 --> 00:22:24.303
Scary Door

00:22:24.386 --> 00:22:25.804
Thursday Night Blernsball

00:22:25.888 --> 00:22:27.222
Futurama